<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef generally weak on moderate demand and moderate to heavy offerings.  Select and Choice rib and round cuts weak, while loin cuts lower and chuck cuts generally steady.  Beef trimmings mostly steady on light to moderate demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>290 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p> 30 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>30 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     100.80	 99.89	 95.73	 94.76</p>
<p>Changes	  -0.50	 -0.55	 -0.30	 -0.36</p>
<p>Rib	  148.13	144.41	136.31	136.24</p>
<p>Chuck	 68.25	 66.80	 70.17	 66.39</p>
<p>Round	 87.92	 87.92	 85.91	 85.91</p>
<p>Loin	 165.31	165.01	146.79	147.54</p>
<p>Brisket     59.78	 59.78	 59.85	 59.85</p>
<p>Shrt Plate  64.92	 64.84	 65.17	 65.00</p>
<p>Flank	 53.45	 53.45	 54.07	 54.07</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
